# Fire Magic, tiered (CR 702.183a): Fire ({R} + {0}) deals 1 damage to each creature, both players', so Bot1's own Mother of
# Runes (1/1) dies and Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) survives with 1 damage marked. With a Mountain and a Plains only, Fira
# ({R} + {2}) and Firaga ({R} + {5}) each still owe their cost once the Mountain has paid {R}: those casts are cancelled,
# and the same Mountain then casts Fire (the positive control).

